- name: clarke
  id: kyttar_clarke_transform
  parameters:
    affinity: ''
    alias: ''
    comment: "ON CHIP: the amplitude-invariant two-current Clarke. i_alpha = ia; i_beta = (ia + 2*ib)/sqrt(3).\
      \ One cell, a two-arm face-locking rendezvous \u2014 the two inputs MUST reach it on two different\
      \ faces."
    device_id: '"kyttar_0"'
    maxoutbuf: '0'
    minoutbuf: '0'
