    alias: ''
    autoscale: 'False'
    axislabels: 'True'
    comment: "THE DEMO PLOT \u2014 the loop regulating. i_q climbs to the torque reference and i_d is\
      \ held at zero. The buffer is a FULL burst: a short buffer paints nothing when the batch arrives\
      \ at once, and the kyttar sink emits q15/32768 floats, so the y axis is in Q15 units."
